 10 minute(s).","params":["100%","10"],"buffIds":[1103905001],"addProp":[]},{"index":6,"name":"闻道者的觉悟","nameEn":"Seeker's Devotion","desc":"角色拾取固有技能天籁时，附近队伍中所有角色的冷凝伤害加成提升12%，持续20秒。","descEn":"When Euphonia is picked up, increase the Glacio DMG Bonus of all characters nearby by 12% for 20s.","params":["12%","20"],"buffIds":[1103906001],"addProp":[]}],"avatar":"assets/avatars/1103.webp?v=4e896c70a4a2"}}